  "title": "Saharan West African Peanut and Pineapple Soup",
  "description": "Peanuts are commonly used in soups and stews in many African cuisines. This west African recipe uses it with tomatoes and pineapple to tasty effect.",
  "authors": [
    "Joy Kimberly"
  ],
  "date_published": "2019-04-03T23:56:40-04:00",
